      "text": "The harpy uses the wind to pull its prey closer. A target within 20 feet must succeed at a DC 36 Fortitude save save or be pulled adjacent to the harpy, where they make a jaws Strike against the target. If the target was pulled off the ground and can't fly, it then falls as normal."
